# Obsidian vault (Cursor)

Personal agent vault: `lattice-agent-vault/` (gitignored — not part of Lattice repo history).

## Split responsibilities

| Need | Tool | Do NOT |
|------|------|--------|
| Codebase architecture, symbols, deps | `graphify query/path/explain` | Read vault or grep the whole repo |
| Session memory, decisions, project context | Vault (`brain/`, `work/`, `wiki/`) | Dump vault into context |
| Obsidian syntax (wikilinks, bases, canvas) | obsidian-skills in `.cursor/skills/` | Guess Obsidian format |

## Token rules

1. Read `lattice-agent-vault/CRITICAL_FACTS.md` (~120 tokens) before any vault work.
2. Read note `description` frontmatter before full note bodies.
3. Use QMD when installed: `qmd --index lattice-agent-vault query "<question>"`.
4. For second-brain commands, read only the one command file from `lattice-agent-vault/.second-brain/commands/`.
5. Skip `lattice-agent-vault/_vendor/` unless upgrading submodules.

## Skills

- **obsidian-mind** — om-* workflows, brain/, work/, perf/
- **obsidian-second-brain** — save, ingest, architect, reconcile, research
- **obsidian-markdown/cli/bases/json-canvas** — format reference

## Lattice codebase docs

Store maintained architecture in `lattice-agent-vault/reference/lattice/` and `wiki/projects/`. Refresh with `/obsidian-architect` (second-brain) after major refactors. Cross-link to `brain/Key Decisions.md` for ADRs.
